flowchart LR
    Durable[Recorded rollout items\nreconstruction-oriented history]
    Normalize[Normalize history\npair calls and outputs\nrepair interrupted tails]
    Retain[Retain relevant items\nand current world state]
    Compact{Fits usable\ncontext window?}
    Summary[Compaction summary\nnew context window]
    Inject[Inject current facts\nAGENTS.md, config, environment, skills, tool specs]
    Request[Model request constrained\nby context policy]
    Durable --> Normalize --> Retain --> Compact
    Compact -- yes --> Inject
    Compact -- no --> Summary --> Inject
    Inject --> Request
    Summary -. durable compaction item .-> Durable
